{"2327110": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Snap Quest", "steam_appid": 2327110, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h1>Stay Connected!</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2327110/extras/4ea656452c2161863b4c3e9980385fda.poster.avif?t=1783034094\" width=600 height=100 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2327110/extras/4ea656452c2161863b4c3e9980385fda.webm?t=1783034094\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2327110/extras/4ea656452c2161863b4c3e9980385fda.mp4?t=1783034094\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2327110/extras/b6fe042bf93840bed92fcf3e6b1c4534.avif?t=1783034094\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2327110/extras_big/b6fe042bf93840bed92fcf3e6b1c4534.avif?t=1783034094 width=1560 height=892 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">~Wishlist to get alerted when the demo goes live~</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><br>In <strong>Snap Quest</strong>, a cozy photo adventure, you’re called back to Star Island to h̶͉̓ḙ̴͊l̶̙̉͘p̵̼̂  your grandmother reclaim her lost research. Years of work mysteriously lost. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the role of an island researcher and wildlife photographer. <strong>Solve clever puzzles</strong>, <strong>snap photos of never-before-seen creatures</strong>, and s̷̤͐ȃ̵̙v̸̻͌ę̷̉  your discoveries in your very own scientific journal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Restore </strong>ẗ̶́h̸̙͆e̵̟̚ i̵̺͐s̶̳̐l̶̛̰ä̸́ͅň̴͓d̵̩̉ with your unique style. Decorate, rebuild, and shape the island's future. Along the way, meet quirky locals, form lasting friendships, and uncover the truth behind the disappearing research.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2327110/extras/640af42cae0e7d9257ada391c966c8fa.poster.avif?t=1783034094\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2327110/extras/640af42cae0e7d9257ada391c966c8fa.webm?t=1783034094\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2327110/extras/640af42cae0e7d9257ada391c966c8fa.mp4?t=1783034094\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your Camera to document your findings! Find and upgrade camera components to uncover lost scientific discoveries!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2327110/extras/728d8ab943bff83d0f4aae9deeae791d.poster.avif?t=1783034094\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2327110/extras/728d8ab943bff83d0f4aae9deeae791d.webm?t=1783034094\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2327110/extras/728d8ab943bff83d0f4aae9deeae791d.mp4?t=1783034094\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Travel through diverse environments, day and night, to experience the strange wildlife first hand.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2327110/extras/f2d985235994099747393d600719d0a2.poster.avif?t=1783034094\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2327110/extras/f2d985235994099747393d600719d0a2.webm?t=1783034094\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2327110/extras/f2d985235994099747393d600719d0a2.mp4?t=1783034094\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Catalogue decor with your camera and customize the island to bring tourism back!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2327110/extras/d928acd48f022dc5d9316a9d9f3056a4.poster.avif?t=1783034094\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2327110/extras/d928acd48f022dc5d9316a9d9f3056a4.webm?t=1783034094\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2327110/extras/d928acd48f022dc5d9316a9d9f3056a4.mp4?t=1783034094\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make friends with the residents and they may assist you in your journey. Perhaps something more may bloom from your relationships.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2327110/extras/7474bc770e2a00b7e83d9eafb5d89190.poster.avif?t=1783034094\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2327110/extras/7474bc770e2a00b7e83d9eafb5d89190.webm?t=1783034094\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps